{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Mouth to mouth I speak with him.</b> The intent is without the mediation of an angel; and 'and I show him' — that is, I show him the thing as it is, in the manner of the form of the Mishkan, concerning which it is written (Exodus 25): ״וראה ועשה בתבניתם״." "<b>In My servant, in Moses.</b> Our Rabbis, of blessed memory, interpreted: 'In My servant' — even if he were not Moses; 'in Moses' — even if he were not My servant. How much more so, since he is both My servant and he is Moses."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:31:50.715117758Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}